note draft

# SHELVED 2026-10-02 (base-v1-0019): cast and hook with a browser native only; out of the v1 cut. It declared tasks that bound nothing, so a call built clean and
# threw `stub` at run time; out of the build until it has bodies.


# Network request and response.

form request
  link method, like text
  link url, like text
  link body, like text

form response
  link status, like integer
  link body, like text

task cast
  # Make a request
  note async
  take request, like request
  like response

task hook
  # Handle a response
  take response, like response
